OL,3,GNEWSAArrests made in investigation into
OL,4,APresbyterian Church in Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested as part
OL,7,Fof an investigation into safeguarding
OL,8,Fconcerns at the Presbyterian Church in
OL,9,FIreland.
OL,11,FThere have been 127 contacts made with
OL,12,Fpolice from potential victims or
OL,13,Fwitnesses, the Police Service of
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland (PSNI) said.
OL,16,FTheir investigation into the church was
OL,17,Fannounced in November last year.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
