OL,3,GNEWSAArrests made in investigation into
OL,4,APresbyterian Church in Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt came after the church said there
OL,7,Fwere "serious and significant failings
OL,8,Fin the central safeguarding functions
OL,9,Fof the Presbyterian Church in Ireland
OL,10,Ffrom the period 2009 to 2022".
